{"schema":"claim/0.1","id":"c-vj-0001","version":1,"domain":"jingang","subject_anchor":"vcpp/1","type":"textual","proposition":"笈多本開卷有「歸命一切佛菩薩海等」的禮敬文，其餘五本開卷即「如是我聞」；這一句使笈多本的行號整體後移一行。","stance":"editor","said_by":"actor:me","recorded_by":"actor:me","vouched_by":"actor:me","origin":"human","evidence":[{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.238","space":"line","start":3,"end":3,"quote":"歸命一切佛菩薩海等"},{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.235","space":"line","start":3,"end":3,"quote":"如是我聞"},{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.236","space":"line","start":3,"end":3,"quote":"如是我聞"},{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.237","space":"line","start":3,"end":3,"quote":"如是我聞"},{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.220.577","space":"line","start":3,"end":3,"quote":"如是我聞"},{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.239","space":"line","start":4,"end":4,"quote":"如是我聞"}],"relations":[],"status":"reviewed","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","date":"2026-10-21"}
{"schema":"claim/0.1","id":"c-vj-0002","version":1,"domain":"jingang","subject_anchor":"vcpp/1","type":"lexical","proposition":"同一句「一時…」中的世尊稱號，六譯各不相同：「佛」（羅什）、「婆伽婆」（留支）、「佛婆伽婆」（真諦）、「世尊」（笈多）、「薄伽梵」（玄奘、義淨）。","stance":"editor","said_by":"actor:me","recorded_by":"actor:me","vouched_by":"actor:me","origin":"human","evidence":[{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.235","space":"line","start":5,"end":5,"quote":"佛在舍衛國"},{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.236","space":"line","start":4,"end":5,"quote":"一時婆伽婆"},{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.237","space":"line","start":5,"end":5,"quote":"佛婆伽婆"},{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.238","space":"line","start":5,"end":6,"quote":"一時世尊"},{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.220.577","space":"line","start":5,"end":5,"quote":"薄伽梵在室羅筏"},{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.239","space":"line","start":6,"end":6,"quote":"薄伽梵在名稱大城"}],"relations":[],"status":"reviewed","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","date":"2026-10-21"}
{"schema":"claim/0.1","id":"c-vj-0003","version":1,"domain":"jingang","subject_anchor":"vcpp/2","type":"textual","proposition":"留支本在「世尊！云何菩薩大乘中，發阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心」之前有「住分第三」的分科標記，比昭明第三分（起於「佛告須菩提」）早了十行；同一部經在同一份並行文本裡有兩套分界不一致的分科。","stance":"editor","said_by":"actor:me","recorded_by":"actor:me","vouched_by":null,"origin":"human","evidence":[{"kind":"annotation","annotation":"a-vj-006"},{"kind":"annotation","annotation":"a-vj-002"},{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.235","space":"line","start":31,"end":31,"quote":"佛告須菩提"}],"relations":[],"status":"draft","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","date":"2026-10-21"}
{"schema":"claim/0.1","id":"c-vj-0004","version":1,"domain":"jingang","subject_anchor":"vcpp/3","type":"doctrinal","proposition":"六本在「卵生、胎生、濕生、化生」的四生列舉上完全一致，可用作跨譯本的自動對齊錨點。","stance":"editor","said_by":"actor:claude","recorded_by":"actor:me","vouched_by":null,"origin":"machine","evidence":[{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.235","space":"line","start":33,"end":33,"quote":"卵生"},{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.238","space":"line","start":34,"end":34,"quote":"卵生"},{"kind":"text","edition":"YLZ.220.577","space":"line","start":33,"end":33,"quote":"卵生"},{"kind":"text","edition":"SANSKRIT","space":"line","start":33,"end":33,"quote":"aṇḍajā"}],"relations":[],"status":"draft","license":"CC0-1.0","date":"2026-10-21"}
{"schema":"claim/0.1","id":"c-vj-0005","version":1,"domain":"jingang","subject_anchor":"vcpp","type":"textual","proposition":"留支本同時登記了兩套分科標記：第 2 行既有昭明的「法會因由」（ck1）又有「序分第一」，第 13 行有「護念付囑分第二」，第 21 行有「住分第三」。","stance":"editor","said_by":"actor:me","recorded_by":"actor:me","vouched_by":"actor:me","origin":"human","evidence":[{"kind":"annotation","annotation":"a-vj-003"},{"kind":"annotation","annotation":"a-vj-004"},{"kind":"annotation","annotation":"a-vj-005"},{"kind":"annotation","annotation":"a-vj-006"}],"relations":[],"status":"reviewed","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","date":"2026-10-21"}
{"schema":"claim/0.1","id":"c-vj-0006","version":1,"domain":"jingang","subject_anchor":"vcpp/1","type":"lexical","proposition":"「遺教序」之名，出自佛將入涅槃時阿難問「一切經初置何等語」，佛答「一切經初當安如是我聞」，遺言令安此六事，故名遺教序。","stance":"source","said_by":"person:jizang","recorded_by":"actor:me","vouched_by":null,"origin":"source","evidence":[{"kind":"text","edition":"T33.1699","space":"char","start":86,"end":100,"quote":"遺言令安此六事，故名遺教序。"}],"relations":[],"status":"draft","license":"PD","date":"2026-10-21"}
{"schema":"claim/0.1","id":"c-vj-0007","version":1,"domain":"jingang","subject_anchor":"vcpp/1","type":"lexical","proposition":"「證信序」又名通序（諸經通有）、經後序（佛初說經本無此序，結集時始加入）、遺教序（佛將涅槃，阿難欽奉遺命，經首置如是我聞），四名同指一事。","stance":"source","said_by":"person:jiang-weinong","recorded_by":"actor:me","vouched_by":null,"origin":"source","evidence":[{"kind":"text","edition":"JJN.B23","space":"char","start":0,"end":94,"quote":"此證信序，又名通序，諸經通有故。亦名經後序，佛初說經，本無此序，至結集時，始加入故。亦名遺教序，佛將涅槃，阿難尊者欽奉遺命，一切經首，當置如是我聞，一時佛在某處，與某大眾若干人俱，等語故。"}],"relations":[],"status":"draft","license":"EXCERPT","date":"2026-10-21"}
{"schema":"claim/0.1","id":"c-vj-0008","version":1,"domain":"jingang","subject_anchor":"vcpp/1","type":"lexical","proposition":"「如是我聞」是編集經典者（阿難）自稱親聞於佛；弟子曾問佛「他時編集經教，當如何起首」，佛答「從如是我聞起」。","stance":"source","said_by":"person:wang-rihxiu","recorded_by":"actor:me","vouched_by":null,"origin":"source","evidence":[{"kind":"text","edition":"JGJZ","space":"char","start":41,"end":63,"quote":"如是我闻者。如此经之所言。乃我亲闻之于佛也。"}],"relations":[],"status":"draft","license":"EXCERPT","date":"2026-10-21"}
{"schema":"claim/0.1","id":"c-vj-0009","version":1,"domain":"jingang","subject_anchor":"vcpp/1","type":"lexical","proposition":"佛將涅槃時，阿難問「佛滅度後一切經首初安何字」，佛答「初安如是我聞，次顯處所」；李文會並引傅大士偈為證。","stance":"source","said_by":"person:li-wenhui","recorded_by":"actor:me","vouched_by":null,"origin":"source","evidence":[{"kind":"text","edition":"JGJZ","space":"char","start":98,"end":116,"quote":"如是我闻者。如来临涅盘日。阿难问曰。"}],"relations":[],"status":"draft","license":"EXCERPT","date":"2026-10-21"}
{"schema":"claim/0.1","id":"c-vj-0010","version":1,"domain":"jingang","subject_anchor":"vcpp/1","type":"lexical","proposition":"傅大士偈：「如來涅槃日，娑羅雙樹間，阿難沒憂海，悲慟不能前，優波初請問，經首立何言，佛教如是者，萬代古今傳。」","stance":"source","said_by":"person:fudashi","recorded_by":"actor:me","vouched_by":null,"origin":"source","evidence":[{"kind":"text","edition":"JGJZ","space":"char","start":150,"end":198,"quote":"如来涅盘日。娑罗双树间。阿难没忧海。悲恸不能前。优波初请问。经首立何言。佛教如是者。万代古今传。"}],"relations":[],"status":"draft","license":"EXCERPT","date":"2026-10-21"}
{"schema":"claim/0.1","id":"c-vj-0011","version":1,"domain":"jingang","subject_anchor":"vcpp/1","type":"lexical","proposition":"「一時」是說此般若經的時候。","stance":"source","said_by":"person:sengzhao","recorded_by":"actor:me","vouched_by":null,"origin":"source","evidence":[{"kind":"text","edition":"JGJZ","space":"char","start":278,"end":289,"quote":"一时者。说此般若时也。"}],"relations":[],"status":"draft","license":"PD","date":"2026-10-21"}
{"schema":"claim/0.1","id":"c-vj-0012","version":1,"domain":"jingang","subject_anchor":"vcpp/1","type":"lexical","proposition":"「舍衛國」是波斯匿王所居之國；「祇樹」是祇陀太子所施之樹。","stance":"source","said_by":"person:huneng","recorded_by":"actor:me","vouched_by":null,"origin":"source","evidence":[{"kind":"text","edition":"JGJZ","space":"char","start":317,"end":331,"quote":"舍卫国者。波斯匿王所居之国。"}],"relations":[],"status":"draft","license":"EXCERPT","date":"2026-10-21"}
{"schema":"claim/0.1","id":"c-vj-0013","version":1,"domain":"jingang","subject_anchor":"vcpp/1","type":"lexical","proposition":"「次第乞」是不越貧從富、不捨賤從貴，大慈平等，無有選擇。","stance":"source","said_by":"person:seng-ruone","recorded_by":"actor:me","vouched_by":null,"origin":"source","evidence":[{"kind":"text","edition":"JGJZ","space":"char","start":421,"end":448,"quote":"不越贫从富。不舍贱从贵。大慈平等。无有选择。故曰次第。"}],"relations":[],"status":"draft","license":"EXCERPT","date":"2026-10-21"}
